From 4fdf3fdef4143bc98f312c03c6aac52d49d7bccb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: localhost-copilot <318096335+localhost-copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 22:04:28 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] media: t7-hdmirx: report capture source races through XRUN

Keep PCM parameter negotiation independent of asynchronous ACR/AIF and link updates. Configure the recovered audio path in prepare only while its qualified format matches the negotiated rate. Source discontinuities leave the FIFO gated and are reported by the monitor as XRUN after PCM START, including the monitor-before-START race.

Retain real clock, FIFO ownership and PLL failures. Restore the generic ASoC diagnostics now that expected source transitions no longer return errors through hw_params or prepare.
